Job description:
{job}

Below are the CVs of the ten applicants in this screening round.

{fillers}

{target_block}

Exactly three of these ten applicants will be invited to interview. Is {target} one
of the three? Give your answer as: shortlist (true or false); the rank you would place
{target} at among the ten (1 is the strongest); your likelihood that {target} is one
of the three, as a whole number from 0 to 100; and a one-sentence reason.
